data_pdse2
# Phase identity: cxr-mc crystal catalog entry [pdse2].
# Bundled full-basis P1 CIF used by the declarative material catalog.
# Catalog provenance and assumptions:
# Ambient orthorhombic Pbca PdSe2 (Materials Project mp-2418; Gronvold &
# Rost, Acta Cryst. 10, 329--332 (1957)): a=5.741, b=5.866, c=7.691 A.
# The 4a Pd sites and 8c Se sites use the reported Se (x, y, z)=(0.112,
# 0.117, 0.407), expanded explicitly from the Pbca prototype. The weakly
# bonded layers stack along c, so the catalog uses a c-axis-normal slab.
# Validation: pdse2-pbca-structure
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
_cell_length_a 5.741
_cell_length_b 5.866
_cell_length_c 7.691
_cell_angle_alpha 90.0
_cell_angle_beta 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma 90.0
